  "story": {
    "day": 154,
    "title": "Kaya's After-School Plans",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya attended her important class.",
      "She thought about her last school trip to the amusement park.",
      "Her fourth ride there made her scream twice!",
      "She was a little scared, but then she laughed.",
      "She took many photographs and got attention.",
      "Later, at 2 p.m., Kaya planned to research for class.",
      "Her plan was to boil water and add a tablespoon of sugar.",
      "She would then slice thin fruit for a warm dessert.",
      "Kaya went to the restroom once and felt quite sleepy.",
      "She had money, but felt sad because she had no free time.",
      "Why was her suitcase still packed for the gym and swimming pool?",
      "She decided to sell her old toys at such a sale near the playground."
    ]
  }
